tape_transcript = "Dr. Thorne, Cleanroom Lab. If you are hearing this, the gallery capacitors are held under automatic safety interlock. Do not trip the breakers out of order—the cryogenic coolant loop will blow its safety seals and force an interlock reset. The charging sequence must strictly follow the optical path: Bay A Cryo-Coolant first, then Bay C Oscillator, and Bay B Magnetic Flux last. One, then three, then two."
