tape_transcript = "The silhouettes have concentrated around the dome console platform. Direct light will not clear them in time, but a closed triad of reflected beams will sweep the entire dome floor. Station Alpha must be set to 45 degrees, Station Beta to 135 degrees, and Station Gamma to 315 degrees. Once the reflected triangle locks, enter the Master Azimuth code on the console keypad: 8352. Eight, three, five, two. Then engage the discharge lever and seal the dome shutter."
