tape_title = "Log 80-E: Houston Telemetry Dispatch"
tape_transcript = "Emergency Dispatch. Flight Director Vance, Houston link. Leo, the silhouettes have clustered on the Coude console platform. The only way to clear them is an equilateral circuit of reflected light across the dome floor. Station Alpha to 45 degrees, Station Beta to 135 degrees, Station Gamma to 315 degrees. When the beam forms the closed triangle, the platform will be clear. Enter Master Azimuth 8352 on the console, pull the primary discharge lever to collapse the return conduit, and seal the shutter."

